# Human-selected extra Python packages for a deployment image.
#
# Odoo's own src/odoo/requirements.txt is always included automatically when
# generating requirements.lock.txt. Do not copy full OCA/provider repository
# requirements.txt files here just because the repository is present.
#
# Add only the extra Python packages actually needed by the selected addons in
# this image. Pin the version here when the addon needs a known compatible
# version.
#
# This file installs packages. requirements-constraints.in does not install
# anything; it only limits versions of packages requested elsewhere.
#
# Examples:
# phonenumbers==8.13.47
# openpyxl==3.1.5
